# BuildKit applies this file, instead of a root .dockerignore, to builds of the Dockerfile next to it. It only
# matters when building from a working checkout: the scanner builds from a fresh clone, which has none of these.
# The gitignored p2p-transfer/Cargo.lock is stale local state (see p2p-transfer/CLAUDE.md).
**/target
**/node_modules
p2p-transfer/dist
p2p-transfer/Cargo.lock
